appjail4win is an AppJail for deploying Windows virtual machines on FreeBSD as [vmjails](https://github.com/DtxdF/overlord/wiki), powered by [Overlord](https://github.com/DtxdF/overlord) and aimed at making setup simple and reproducible instead of requiring you to assemble the virtualization pieces yourself. It works with any Windows version you provide an ISO for, supports unattended installs through `autounattend.xml`, gives each VM a disposable system disk plus a persistent data disk so user files survive rebuilds, and allows profile-based customization via templates and attributes. It also integrates with [Security Groups](https://github.com/DtxdF/AppJail/wiki/filter) for network filtering and [can be routed through Tor](https://github.com/appJail-makejails/vm#tor) with some network and DNS tweaking.
